        "description": "Response payload for the echo endpoint.\n\nAttributes\n----------\ntext : str\n    Echoed text.\nlength : int\n    Length of the provided text.\n\nExamples\n--------\n>>> EchoResponse(text=\"abc\", length=3).model_dump()\n{'text': 'abc', 'length': 3}",
