  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/echo": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Create an echo record and return its representation.\n\nParameters\n----------\npayload : EchoRequest\n    Request body containing the text to echo (and optional `source_url`).\nresponse : fastapi.Response\n    Raw HTTP response used to set headers (e.g., `Location`) for 201 Created.\nservice : EchoService\n    Injected dependency from centralized accessors.\n\nReturns\n-------\nEchoResponse\n    Representation of the echoed text, including its character length.\n\nRaises\n------\nValueError\n    Propagated if the underlying repository rejects invalid data (e.g., negative length).\n\nExamples\n--------\n```python\n>>> from fastapi.testclient import TestClient\n>>> from your_service_name.backend.main import create_app\n>>> client = TestClient(create_app())\n>>> resp = client.post(\"/api/v1/echo\", json={\"text\": \"hello\"})\n>>> resp.status_code\n201\n>>> resp.headers[\"Location\"].endswith(\"/api/v1/echo/history\")\nTrue\n>>> resp.json()\n{'text': 'hello', 'length': 5}\n```\n\nNotes\n-----\n- REST: 201 Created + `Location` header. For now, `Location` points to the collection\n  (`/api/v1/echo/history`). If per-item identifiers are introduced later, update it to\n  `/api/v1/echo/{id}`.",
        "operationId": "echo_api_v1_echo_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EchoRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EchoResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Not Found"
          },
          "413": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Content Too Large"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationProblem"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unprocessable Content"
          },
          "429": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Too Many Requests"
          },
          "500": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Echo",
        "tags": [
          "echo"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/echo/history": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Return previously stored echo entries.\n\nParameters\n----------\nservice : EchoService\n    Injected dependency; repository accessed via ``service.repo``.\n\nReturns\n-------\nlist[EchoResponse]\n    History of echoed items.\n\nExamples\n--------\n```python\n>>> from fastapi.testclient import TestClient\n>>> from your_service_name.backend.main import create_app\n>>> client = TestClient(create_app())\n>>> _ = client.post(\"/api/v1/echo\", json={\"text\": \"abc\"})\n>>> _ = client.post(\"/api/v1/echo\", json={\"text\": \"xyz\"})\n>>> resp = client.get(\"/api/v1/echo/history\")\n>>> resp.status_code\n200\n>>> resp.json()\n[{'text': 'abc', 'length': 3}, {'text': 'xyz', 'length': 3}]\n```",
        "operationId": "history_api_v1_echo_history_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EchoResponse"
                  },
                  "title": "Response History Api V1 Echo History Get",
                  "type": "array"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
